## Summary
The owner's own Loom (Thoughtform_Diagrams Breakdown.mp4, recorded 2026-10-11). The owner pages through Pinterest references and the local Holo UI artifact to show the diagram language he wants: built like a terminal interface, mathematical and exact, isometric where it helps, 2D and 3D in one design language with 3D used sparingly (small icons stay 2D), and navigation and technical manuals as the leitmotif. The core proposition reads as a linear axis: adoption upstream on the left, the Thoughtform mark at the centre, automation downstream on the right. Use it for any diagram or visual-system pass.

